    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "同步请求",
      "items": [
        "RefreshTokenInterceptor 从 Redis 恢复用户，LoginInterceptor 决定是否放行",
        "RateLimitAspect 以 Lua 滑动窗口或令牌桶执行 GLOBAL / IP / USER 限流"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "异步一致性",
      "items": [
        "秒杀先在 Redis 原子预扣减，再由 RocketMQ 消费者事务落库",
        "订单创建后发送 30 分钟延时消息；取消成功后幂等回补 Redis 状态"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "当前配置边界",
      "items": [
        "docker-compose 启动 MySQL、Redis、Canal；RocketMQ 来自外部 study-agent 网络",
        "RedissonConfig 指向 localhost:6379，而 Spring Redis 配置为 localhost:12379，运行前需统一"
      ]
    }
